# Issue #125: the group declared first, then a keep filter around it
# (block J of devlog/104-try-it.dfd). The replacement does not
# initialise the kept set: "!" starts empty and selects two levels
# downstream of A1 and Z on the grouped graph. Expected: A1, A2, A3,
# Z, C1, C2, C3; no orphan.

style vertical

process A1
process A2
process A3
process B1
process B2
process B3
process C1
process C2
process C3
process Z Group

A1 -> B1 a1b1
B1 -> C1 b1c1
A2 -> B2 a2b2
B2 -> C2 b2c2
A3 -> B3 a3b3
B3 -> C3 b3c3
A1 ->? A2 a1a2
A2 ->? A3 a2a3
B1 ->? B2 b1b2
B2 ->? B3 b2b3
C1 ->? C2 c1c2
C2 ->? C3 c2c3
A1 ->? B2 a1b2
B1 --? C2 b1c2

~=Z B1 B2 B3
!>2 A1 Z
